  "steps": [
    "In a bowl, soak 30g raisins in 50ml hot water for 30 minutes. Now add 2 tbsp unsweetened peanut butter (32g) and salt a pinch of salt, Mash it and mix together if you like it chunkly or you can blend it if you like it smooth.",
    "Add 1½ cups puffed rice (25g) and 2 tbsp pumpkin seeds (20g), Mix it all well.",
    "Transfer it to a container liner with parchment paper ans press it down nicely. Transfer the mixture to a container lined with parchment paper and press it down firmly.",
